  "markdown": "FORCE OF NATURE™\nMADE WITH 100%\n\n\nGRASS FED BEEF\nANCESTRAL BLEND\nGROUND BEEF, BEEF LIVER, BEEF HEART\n\n\n[A bull standing in a field]\nPREVIOUSLY FROZEN FOR YOUR PROTECTION\nKEEP REFRIGERATED OR FROZEN\n\n\n<figure type=\"ILLUSTRATION\">\n\n<description>A close-up illustration of text highlighting nutritional information. The text is arranged in three lines with a dark brown, blocky, sans-serif typeface against a textured, light beige background. The top line reads '22g' in large font. The middle line reads 'PROTEIN' in a slightly smaller, bold font. The bottom line reads 'PER SERVING' in a smaller font.</description></figure>\n\nREGENERATIVELY\nSOURCED*\n\n\nNET WT. \n16 OZ (1LB) \n\n[STAMPED]\nU.S. INSPECTED AND PASSED BY DEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE\n\n\n*Force of Nature defines holistic regenerative grazing as planned\nrotational grazing, leaving ground cover, and allowing adequate\nrecovery time between grazing rotations.\nCertified to Global\nAnimal Partnership\nstandards by\nA Greener World\nEarthClaims, LLC\n\n\n[COW_ICON]\nANIMAL\nWELFARE\nCERTIFIED\nCertified to Global\nPASTURE\nRAISED\n[ICON]\nAnimal Partnership\nstandards by\nEarthClaims, LLC\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01ky3pebj0fnnq8nkkwd8a2sve -->",
